%% TH-8088 job state machine (Mermaid stateDiagram-v2)
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> submitting_prepared: Lua accept (idem NX + reserve)
  submitting_prepared --> submitting_calling: worker claims lease, writes phase=calling
  submitting_prepared --> cancelled: cancel before any call (pre_submit, release)
  submitting_prepared --> failed: submit_by elapsed / provider disabled (release)
  submitting_calling --> queued: provider ack persisted (phase=received)
  submitting_calling --> running: provider ack already running
  submitting_calling --> failed: synchronous rejection 4xx (release) / provider_access_denied
  submitting_calling --> submission_unknown: lost response / owner died while calling
  submission_unknown --> queued: reconciliation found provider job
  submission_unknown --> submitting_prepared: proven absent (ByToken only)
  submission_unknown --> failed: reconcile_by elapsed -> submission_unresolved (retry_safe=false, unsettled)
  queued --> running
  queued --> cancelled: provider-confirmed cancel (QueuedOnly / QueuedAndRunning)
  queued --> completed: terminal success + artifact copied (or unavailable)
  queued --> failed: provider failed / expired / run_by elapsed (provider_timeout)
  running --> completed
  running --> failed
  running --> cancelled: provider-confirmed cancel (QueuedAndRunning only)
  completed --> [*]
  failed --> [*]
  cancelled --> [*]
  note right of completed
    substates: artifacts[i].state pending|copying|available|unavailable|expired|deleted
    settlement_state reserved|settled|released|unsettled
  end note
  note right of failed
    provider_timeout keeps reconciliation.state=pending;
    late success settles cost, never flips status (D11)
  end note
